          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "سجل (sajjala) is a Form II verb made from sijill, \"a written record, a deed\", which Lane lists under s-j-l. Sijill is usually traced to Greek sigillion, from Latin sigillum, \"seal\"; Lane gives no foreign source."
            }
          ]
